{"id":56075,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=56075"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:26:43","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:26:43","slug":"trilhos-dos-casainhos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-dos-casainhos\/","title":{"rendered":"XVI Trilhos de Casainhos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">XVI Trilhos de Casainhos 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os <strong>XVI Trilhos de Casainhos 2026<\/strong> realizam-se no dia <strong>29 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), em <strong>Casainhos, Fanh\u00f5es<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Loures<\/strong> (distrito de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-lisboa\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Lisboa<\/a>). Documentada desde 2009, esta \u00e9 reconhecida como a prova de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail-running\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">trail running<\/a> mais antiga do distrito de Lisboa, integrando o calend\u00e1rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trails-novembro\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">trails em novembro<\/a> com partidas faseadas no <strong>Campo de Futebol do Sporting Clube de Casainhos<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo \u00e9 composto pelo <strong>Trail Sprint de 18 km<\/strong> (850m D+, partida \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>), pelo <strong>Trail Experience de 10 km<\/strong> (320m D+, partida \u00e0s <strong>10:15<\/strong>) e por uma <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/caminhadas\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">caminhada<\/a> l\u00fadica de <strong>10 km<\/strong> (320m D+, partida \u00e0s <strong>10:30<\/strong>). Os percursos percorrem os trilhos rurais, vales e relevos calc\u00e1rios da hist\u00f3rica freguesia de <strong>Fanh\u00f5es<\/strong> \u2014 famosa pela sua tradi\u00e7\u00e3o de cal\u00e7ada portuguesa \u2014 a poucos minutos da capital. Podes planear os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">calculadora de pace<\/a> e preparar o teu equipamento com o guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/como-escolher-sapatilhas-trail\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">sapatilhas de trail<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o FAZ-TE AOS TRILHOS!<\/strong> e apoio da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Fanh\u00f5es<\/strong>, do <strong>Sporting Clube de Casainhos<\/strong> e dos <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Fanh\u00f5es<\/strong>, a 16\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o passa a integrar oficialmente o <strong>Circuito de Trail da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa (AAL)<\/strong> nas vertentes Sprint e Trail Jovem (Sub-18 e Sub-20). O evento mant\u00e9m ainda o seu forte cariz comunit\u00e1rio com a tradicional feijoada solid\u00e1ria, cuja receita reverte integralmente para os Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Fanh\u00f5es.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word;